That accused herein to reimburse the SCCH12 4 C.C.No.12015/2021 TDR amount have executed the registered agreement of sale on 21.10.2020 in favour of the complainant company by offering the immovable property being the residential villa bearing No.B1 having village Khata No.167/B1 measuring 2990 sq.ft of sital area and 3005 sqft of built up area in the development known as NVT Orchid Garden for sale consideration of INR3,59,27,991/. That accused have also executed Mortgage deed dt.21.10.2020 with the complainant company and agreed in the said deed to pay the Embassy Classi Pvt Ltd vs Good Home Ventures on 8 July, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/38065391/
2 agree amount in 3 installments by issuing cheques for the amount mentioned below;
(a) 1st installment for INR. 1,00,00,000/ (one Crore) payable on or before 30.04.2021 (b) 2nd installment for INR.1,50,00,000/(One Crore Fifty Lakhs only) Payable on or before 31.08.2021 (c) 3rd installment for INR .1,09,027,991/ (One Crore Nine Lakhs Twenty seven thousand nine hundred and ninety one only) only payable on or before 31.12.2021 4.

